          <p>Replace <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:.85em">YOUR_SHEET_ID_HERE</code> with your actual Sheet ID before pasting.</p>
          <div class="code-block" id="apps-script-code">
